<body>
    <h1>Dynamics 365 CRM Azure Permissions</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h2 local-id=3D"d395880c2cb8" id=3D"Dynamics365CRMAzurePermissions-=
PowerPlatformEnterprisePolicyDeploymentandGovernancePlan">Power Platform En=
terprise Policy Deployment and Governance Plan</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"6c06bd795bbb" id=3D"Dynamics365CRMAzurePermissions-Objectiv=
e">Objective</h3>
<p local-id=3D"3f400a138a31">Support a secure deployment process for creati=
ng and linking Power Platform Enterprise Policies to Dataverse environments=
 while:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"91ce92d2-aa4e-4620-a7eb-ba6145a92998">
<li local-id=3D"d1be17f7-8e9c-4b20-a70d-6b03291b149e">
<p local-id=3D"bced21eeca44">Leveraging Azure RBAC group-based administrati=
on.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"9f4341c3-1865-4036-969f-570b19231d09">
<p local-id=3D"c936153e99b5">Minimizing individual Azure role assignments.<=
/p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"c6c59e6d-3bda-4a4b-94f6-69e2e3f01642">
<p local-id=3D"3ed96604f258">Maintaining existing Power Platform Administra=
tor ownership within the DNA organization.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"cdaccbf6-51e6-4bf1-94f6-72ef7a073046">
<p local-id=3D"b28e3f7b23fa">Limit the need to grant elevated Azure or Powe=
r Platform permissions to the BTS Collab Tech or Dataverse Owners.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"11048345-44d5-45b3-8e54-41f795ac3d20">
<p local-id=3D"9117047372c5">Supporting a scalable SDLC-aligned Dataverse-t=
o-Databricks Synapse Link architecture.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"a59ad032910d" id=3D"Dynamics365CRMAzurePermissions-KeyConsi=
derations">Key Considerations</h3>
<p local-id=3D"89fd9c84d1ff">Some steps within the complete lifecycle of es=
tablishing the Synapse Link, particularly initial configuration of the Syna=
pse Link, require the Owner role on Azure resources or the tenant Level Pow=
er Platform Administrator role. Because these are highly privileged permiss=
ions it is key that the operations plan not require these be granted outsid=
e DNA.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"d9b9b5ece176" id=3D"Dynamics365CRMAzurePermissions-Summaryo=
fRequiredOperationsandPermissions">Summary of Required Operations and Permi=
ssions</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1174" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"0db9bc62-2607-46b5-9b2d-f1039ca3f253" class=3D"confluenceTable">
